    "flow.生成高级母大纲": "Generate advanced master outline",
    "flow.请点击真实“生成大纲”。教程播放预置母大纲，不调用 AI。": "Click Generate outline. The tutorial plays a preset master outline without calling AI.",
    "flow.查看分段结果": "View segment results",
