    "flow.保存高级大纲": "Save advanced outline",
    "flow.请点击左侧真实“记忆”导航，查看高级大纲整理出的关联资料。": "Click Memory in the left navigation to see the reference material organized from the advanced outline.",
    "flow.选择教程作品": "Select the tutorial work",
    "flow.请点击记忆页中的“雾城夜巡”，进入这部作品的真实关联文件区域。": "Click “the tutorial work” on the Memory page to open this work’s linked files.",
    "flow.关键事件表和资料索引": "Key events and reference index",
    "flow.二. 阶段生成": "2. Stage generation",
    "flow.母大纲保存后，可以在这里选择 S01、S02 等阶段，继续展开阶段粗纲。": "After saving the master outline, select stages such as S01 or S02 here to expand their outlines.",
    "flow.重试当前段": "Retry current segment",
    "flow.只重新处理出错或不满意的当前分段，不从头重做全部母大纲。": "Reprocess only the current failed or unsatisfactory segment, without restarting the entire master outline.",
    "flow.补全当前段": "Complete current segment",
    "flow.当当前分段被截断时，可以从中断处继续补齐。": "If the current segment is cut off, continue from where it stopped.",
    "flow.复制只把当前内容放入剪贴板，不会保存或重建关联资料。": "Copy only puts the current content on the clipboard; it does not save or rebuild linked material.",
    "flow.折叠配置": "Collapse settings",
    "flow.配置完成后可以收起大纲生成区域，为结果区留出更多空间。": "After configuration, collapse the outline-generation area to leave more room for results.",
    "flow.您完成了高级大纲题材、字数、剧情标签、模型、模拟分段生成和教程内保存，也认识了阶段生成与分段恢复按钮。": "You practiced genre, length, plot tags, model selection, simulated segment generation and saving within the tutorial, and learned about stage generation and segment recovery.",
    "flow.进入高级大纲": "Open advanced outline",
    "flow.展开阶段生成": "Expand stage generation",
    "flow.请点击“二. 阶段生成”右侧箭头。": "Click the arrow beside Stage generation.",
    "flow.打开母大纲选择": "Open master outline selection",
    "flow.请点击真实“选择大纲”。": "Click Choose an outline.",
    "flow.从记忆库加载": "Load from memory",
    "flow.请点击真实“从记忆库加载大纲”。": "Click Load outline from memory.",
    "flow.选择剧情总览": "Select the plot overview",
    "flow.请选择“剧情总览.md”，它是本次阶段粗纲的母大纲。": "Select “Story overview.md”, the master outline for this stage outline.",
    "flow.确认母大纲文件": "Confirm the master outline file",
    "flow.请点击文件弹窗中的真实“确定”。": "Click Confirm in the file dialog.",
    "flow.确认使用母大纲": "Confirm master outline use",
    "flow.请点击选择大纲弹窗中的真实“确定”，让页面识别阶段。": "Click Confirm in the outline-selection dialog so the page can identify the stages.",
    "flow.选择 S01 阶段": "Select stage S01",
    "flow.请打开真实下拉框并选择“S01 地图亮起”。": "Open the dropdown and select “S01 the highlighted demo chapter”.",
    "flow.请点击真实“选择关联文件”。": "Click “Choose reference files”.",
    "flow.逐个选择阶段粗纲资料": "Select stage-outline references one by one",
    "flow.请亲自勾选高亮的资料索引、关键事件表、信息表、角色列表和设定集。它们对应高级大纲的真实默认参考规则。": "Check the five highlighted files: reference index, key events, facts, characters and setting. They follow the advanced outline’s default reference rules.",
    "flow.请选择“DeepSeek V4 Flash”。": "Select “DeepSeek V4 Flash”.",
    "flow.生成阶段粗纲": "Generate stage outline",
    "flow.请点击真实“生成阶段粗纲”。教程播放预置结果。": "Click Generate stage outline. The tutorial plays a preset result.",
    "flow.查看阶段粗纲": "View stage outline",
    "flow.S01 阶段粗纲正在真实结果区流式展示。": "The S01 stage outline is appearing progressively in the result area.",
    "flow.保存阶段粗纲": "Save stage outline",
    "flow.请点击真实保存按钮。教程不会写入记忆库。": "Click Save. The tutorial does not write to the memory library.",
    "flow.阶段选择规则": "Stage selection rules",
    "flow.这里只能展开母大纲中已经存在的阶段，每次选择一个目标阶段。": "Only stages already present in the master outline can be expanded here. Choose one target stage at a time.",
    "flow.关联文件的用途": "How linked files are used",
    "flow.人物与世界观资料会约束阶段粗纲，避免扩写时改名、改设定或越过剧情边界。": "Character and worldbuilding references constrain the stage outline to prevent changed names, altered settings or plot-boundary violations during expansion.",
    "flow.复制与恢复按钮": "Copy and recovery controls",
    "flow.复制不会保存；重试和补全只处理当前分段；折叠按钮用于整理配置区。": "Copy does not save. Retry and Complete affect only the current segment; collapse controls tidy the settings area.",
    "flow.您完成了母大纲、目标阶段、关联文件、模型、模拟生成和教程内保存。": "You practiced selecting a master outline, target stage, linked files and model, then simulated generation and saving within the tutorial.",
    "flow.进入功能性生成": "Open story-element generation",
    "flow.请点击真实“功能性生成”。": "Click “Generate story elements”.",
    "flow.选择“大纲设定”": "Choose Outline settings",
    "flow.请选择本次固定功能“大纲设定”。": "Select the designated function, Outline settings.",
    "flow.打开功能模板": "Open the function template",
