    "flow.教程优化结果已应用，仅在本次演示中有效": "Demo optimization applied for this tutorial only.",
    "flow.将用AI消痕结果覆盖当前章节正文，此操作不可撤销。确定继续？": "Replace the current chapter text with the AI optimization result? This cannot be undone.",
    "flow.确定润色": "Accept polish",
    "flow.🔄 重新润色": "🔄 Polish again",
