    "flow.教程润色结果已采用，仅在本次演示中有效": "Polished text accepted for this tutorial only.",
    "flow.教程改写结果已采用，仅在本次演示中有效": "Rewritten text accepted for this tutorial only.",
    "flow.将自动参考上一章末尾，帮助正文连续衔接。": "The end of the previous chapter will be used automatically to maintain continuity.",
    "flow.优化选中内容": "Optimize selected text",
    "flow.描述想法...": "Describe your ideas...",
    "flow.请描述您希望如何修改这段文字，例如：使这段描写更加生动、调整语气更加正式、增加更多细节描写等...": "Describe how you want to revise this passage, such as making it more vivid, using a more formal tone, or adding detail...",
    "flow.优化结果（未自动写入正文）": "Optimized result (not inserted into the text)",
    "flow.原文位置已发生变化。为保护当前正文，系统没有自动覆盖；本次优化结果已完整保留。": "The original text location has changed. To protect your current text, nothing was overwritten automatically. The full optimized result has been retained.",
    "flow.复制优化结果": "Copy optimized result",
    "flow.会结合作品名称、频道和已选题材生成预览，确认后才填入作品信息。": "A preview uses the work title, audience and selected genres. It is inserted only after confirmation.",
    "flow.关闭生成作品简介弹窗": "Close synopsis generator",
    "flow.主角信息与作品设定": "Protagonist and story setting",
    "flow.填写主角姓名、身份、性别、初始处境、核心事件、能力或世界设定；未提供的内容不会擅自编造": "Enter the protagonist’s name, identity, gender, initial situation, key events, abilities or world setting; missing details should not be invented.",
    "flow.填写作品名称后即可生成。": "Enter a work title to generate.",
    "flow.生成简介": "Generate synopsis",
