    "flow.短篇（10-20万字）": "Short (100k–200k characters)",
    "flow.中篇（50万字）": "Medium (500k characters)",
    "flow.长篇（100万字）": "Long (1 million characters)",
    "flow.超长篇（200万字）": "Extra long (2 million characters)",
    "flow.普通大纲生成模式": "Standard outline generation mode",
    "flow.直出": "Direct",
    "flow.询问": "Interactive",
    "flow.模板信息生成仅用于本次资料建议，不会自动保存、发布或公开提示词。": "Template information generation only suggests metadata for this request. It does not automatically save, publish or make the prompt public.",
    "flow.生成本章使用条件": "Requirements for generating this chapter",
    "flow.按钮变亮前，请完成以下 3 项：": "Complete these 3 items to enable the button:",
    "flow.在章节目录中选中一个正式章节，不能选卷目录或关联资料": "Select an actual chapter in the catalog, not a volume or reference file.",
    "flow.至少选择 1 个与当前作品匹配的关联文件": "Select at least 1 reference file relevant to the current work.",
    "flow.正文生成模式": "Prose generation mode",
    "flow.两种模式分别有以下作用：": "The two modes work as follows:",
